{"id":"n30445-1-7","stage":5,"title":"겸하다 · 兼","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n30445-1-7-1","ko":"감독님, 이번에 영화를 찍으면서 배우도 겸하셨다고요?","zh":"导演，您这次拍电影的同时还兼任了演员吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"감독님,","meaning":"教练，导演","explanation":"감독：教练，导演；님：尊称后缀。","readings":[{"term":"감독","audio":"/audio/7fcf6259bbb0a41897ec.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15979","senseId":"2","lemma":"감독","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"이번에","meaning":"这次，这回","explanation":"이번：这次，这回；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"이번","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29737","senseId":"1","lemma":"이번","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"영화를","meaning":"电影","explanation":"영화：电影；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"영화","audio":"/audio/1f0a9d32bbf42b6d556f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71624","senseId":"1","lemma":"영화","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"찍으면서","meaning":"拍，拍摄","explanation":"찍다：拍，拍摄；으면서：表示同时进行或并列；与 도 合用可表示“同时却、尽管”。","readings":[{"term":"찍다","audio":"/audio/e1e4a898170582452675.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"63320","senseId":"6","lemma":"찍다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"배우도","meaning":"演员","explanation":"배우：演员；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"배우","audio":"/audio/70129359d515b77048d9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58204","senseId":"1","lemma":"배우","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"겸하셨다고요?","meaning":"兼，兼任","explanation":"겸하다：兼，兼任；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；다고요：重复、强调或确认所说的内容；带 요 时为礼貌表达。","readings":[{"term":"겸하다","audio":"/audio/0e9fcc303e92db27e0bb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30445","senseId":"1","lemma":"겸하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"7fcf6259bbb0a418","term":"감독","zh":"教练，导演","audio":"/audio/7fcf6259bbb0a41897ec.mp3","entryId":"15979","definition":"在演出、电影、体育比赛等中指挥并负责全盘事宜的人。","pronunciation":["감독"]},{"id":"da78d4146f0588e8","term":"이번","zh":"这次，这回","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3","entryId":"29737","definition":"马上到来的顺序；或指刚过去的顺序。","pronunciation":["이번"]},{"id":"1f0a9d32bbf42b6d","term":"영화","zh":"电影","audio":"/audio/1f0a9d32bbf42b6d556f.mp3","entryId":"71624","definition":"含有一定的意义，拍摄移动的对象，用放映机投影到银幕上看的综合性艺术。","pronunciation":["영화"]},{"id":"e1e4a89817058245","term":"찍다","zh":"拍，拍摄","audio":"/audio/e1e4a898170582452675.mp3","entryId":"63320","definition":"用照相机照射某个物品，把其样子移动到胶片上。","pronunciation":["찍따"]},{"id":"70129359d515b770","term":"배우","zh":"演员","audio":"/audio/70129359d515b77048d9.mp3","entryId":"58204","definition":"担任电影、话剧或电视剧等中的人物角色进行表演的人。","pronunciation":["배우"]},{"id":"0e9fcc303e92db27","term":"겸하다","zh":"兼，兼任","audio":"/audio/0e9fcc303e92db27e0bb.mp3","entryId":"30445","definition":"一个人除原来担任的工作以外，还担任其他职务。","pronunciation":["겸하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/d2ff52e6f6d5325fdb18.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n30445-1-7-2","ko":"네, 감독을 하면서 배우까지 하려니까 힘들더군요.","zh":"是的，既要当导演又要当演员，实在很辛苦呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네,","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"네：是，行","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17294","senseId":"2","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"감독을","meaning":"教练，导演","explanation":"감독：教练，导演；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"감독","audio":"/audio/7fcf6259bbb0a41897ec.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15979","senseId":"2","lemma":"감독","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"하면서","meaning":"作为，当作","explanation":"하다：作为，当作；면서：表示同时进行或并列；与 도 合用可表示“同时却、尽管”。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"7","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"배우까지","meaning":"演员","explanation":"배우：演员；까지：表示终点或范围：“到、直到、连……都”。","readings":[{"term":"배우","audio":"/audio/70129359d515b77048d9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58204","senseId":"1","lemma":"배우","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"하려니까","meaning":"作为，当作","explanation":"하다：作为，当作；려니까：说明正要或打算做某事时所遇到的情况、想法或困难。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"7","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"힘들더군요.","meaning":"累，费力，费劲，辛苦，用力","explanation":"힘들다：累，费力，费劲，辛苦，用力；더군요：礼貌地回顾亲历的情况并表示感叹。","readings":[{"term":"힘들다","audio":"/audio/8eec39c3609a6c71740f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91737","senseId":"1","lemma":"힘들다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1c0ddfd005093840","term":"네","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3","entryId":"17294","definition":"用于肯定回答长辈所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["네"]},{"id":"7fcf6259bbb0a418","term":"감독","zh":"教练，导演","audio":"/audio/7fcf6259bbb0a41897ec.mp3","entryId":"15979","definition":"在演出、电影、体育比赛等中指挥并负责全盘事宜的人。","pronunciation":["감독"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"作为，当作","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"担任某种职位或起到某种作用。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"70129359d515b770","term":"배우","zh":"演员","audio":"/audio/70129359d515b77048d9.mp3","entryId":"58204","definition":"担任电影、话剧或电视剧等中的人物角色进行表演的人。","pronunciation":["배우"]},{"id":"8eec39c3609a6c71","term":"힘들다","zh":"累，费力，费劲，辛苦，用力","audio":"/audio/8eec39c3609a6c71740f.mp3","entryId":"91737","definition":"有花费很多力气的一面。","pronunciation":["힘들다"]}],"audio":"/audio/e2a09f3ae3254c82e424.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.053,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=30445","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":174,"sequenceScore":3.5297,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["是的，既要当导演又要当演员，实在很辛苦呢。","导演，您这次拍电影的同时还兼任了演员吗？","听说你和丈夫是命中注定的恋人？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["导演，您这次拍电影的同时还兼任了演员吗？","听说你和丈夫是命中注定的恋人？","是的，既要当导演又要当演员，实在很辛苦呢。"],"answer":2}]}
